Defend or attack?. Choose your side for this game. Defend the castle: build towers, hold the walls
How hard?. Your settings say Normal. Normal: as the game is meant
Defend the castle. 1 Summer bridge: open, tutorial. 2 Snow bridge: open, easy. 3 Storm bridge: locked, win 1 or 2 first. 4 Hill fort: locked, win 2 or 3 first. 5 Long bridge: locked, win 3 or 4 first. 6 The city: locked, win 4 or 5 first. 7 Gate maze: locked, win 5 or 6 first. 8 The dungeon: locked, win 6 or 7 first. 9 Second maze: locked, win 7 or 8 first. 10 Treasury: locked, win 8 or 9 first. Chosen: 1 Summer bridge: open, tutorial. Arrows: choose. Enter, space, a number or a click: go. B or Esc: back. ?: help.
Help. The road of levels for your side, in order: the first two are open, and each next one opens when one of the two before it is won. Arrows: choose. Enter, space, its number or a click on it: go there. B, Backspace or Esc: back. Menu bar: H home, D hall of deeds, S settings, ? help, Q leave (or click it). Any key or a click closes this.
Defend the castle. 1 Summer bridge: open, tutorial. 2 Snow bridge: open, easy. 3 Storm bridge: locked, win 1 or 2 first. 4 Hill fort: locked, win 2 or 3 first. 5 Long bridge: locked, win 3 or 4 first. 6 The city: locked, win 4 or 5 first. 7 Gate maze: locked, win 5 or 6 first. 8 The dungeon: locked, win 6 or 7 first. 9 Second maze: locked, win 7 or 8 first. 10 Treasury: locked, win 8 or 9 first. Chosen: 1 Summer bridge: open, tutorial. Arrows: choose. Enter, space, a number or a click: go. B or Esc: back. ?: help.
